"  0   success\n"
"  1   error (D-Bus failure, write refused, bad data)\n"
"  2   daemon absent (apple-kb-monitord not on the session bus)\n"
"  64  usage error (invalid arguments)\n"
"\n"
"FN MODES (hid_apple.fnmode, global to every Apple keyboard):\n"
"  0  disabled   Fn key has no effect\n"
"  1  fkeyslast  media keys by default, Fn+Fx = F-key\n"
"  2  fkeysfirst F-keys by default, Fn+Fx = media key\n"
"  3  auto       kernel default: = 1 on an Apple keyboard\n"
"  4  fkeysdisabled F-keys disabled (media keys only)"
msgstr ""
"AVSLUTNINGSKODER:\n"
"  0   vellykket\n"
"  1   feil (D-Bus-feil, skriving avvist, ugyldige data)\n"
"  2   tjenesten mangler (apple-kb-monitord ikke på øktbussen)\n"
"  64  bruksfeil (ugyldige argumenter)\n"
"\n"
"FN-MODUSER (hid_apple.fnmode, felles for alle Apple-tastaturer):\n"
"  0  disabled   Fn-tasten har ingen virkning\n"
"  1  fkeyslast  medietaster som standard, Fn+Fx = F-tast\n"
"  2  fkeysfirst F-taster som standard, Fn+Fx = medietast\n"
"  3  auto       kjernens standard: = 1 på et Apple-tastatur\n"
"  4  fkeysdisabled F-taster deaktivert (bare medietaster)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
