"hid_apple-parametere (akm-helper, varig, ALLE Apple-tastaturer)"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/cli_strings.rs
msgid "Show what would change, change nothing"
msgstr "Vis hva som ville endres, endre ingenting"

